# Copy to .env for a CLIENT build. Set this to the SAME value as the packaged
# game's DefaultGame.ini [AnomalyControlServer] Token. When present, the dashboard
# pre-fills the token field and connects automatically (zero copy-paste).
# Leave unset for the owner's own dev build (the server then logs a random per-session
# token; paste it manually as before).
VITE_CONTROL_TOKEN=
